      <VERS vnumber="7">And this <STYLE css="font-style:italic">is the blessing</STYLE> of <gr str="3063">Judah</gr>: and he <gr str="559">said</gr>, <gr str="8085">Hear</gr>, <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, the <gr str="6963">voice </gr>of <gr str="3063">Judah</gr>, and <gr str="935">bring </gr>him to his <gr str="5971">people</gr>: let his <gr str="3027">hands </gr>be <gr str="7227">sufficient </gr>for him; and be thou an <gr str="5828">help </gr>
