      <VERS vnumber="8">And of <gr str="3878">Levi </gr>he <gr str="559">said</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">Let</STYLE> thy <gr str="8550">Thummim </gr>and thy <gr str="224">Urim </gr>
