      <VERS vnumber="9">Who <gr str="559">said </gr>to his <gr str="1">father </gr>and to his <gr str="517">mother</gr>, I have not <gr str="7200">seen </gr>him; neither did he <gr str="5234">acknowledge </gr>his <gr str="251">brethren</gr>, nor <gr str="3045">know </gr>his own <gr str="1121">children</gr>: for they have <gr str="8104">observed </gr>thy <gr str="565">word</gr>, and <gr str="5341">kept </gr>thy <gr str="1285">covenant</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10">They shall <gr str="3384">teach </gr>
