      <VERS vnumber="18">And of <gr str="2074">Zebulun </gr>he <gr str="559">said</gr>, <gr str="8055">Rejoice</gr>, <gr str="2074">Zebulun</gr>, in thy going <gr str="3318">out</gr>; and, <gr str="3485">Issachar</gr>, in thy <gr str="168">tents</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="19">They shall <gr str="7121">call </gr>the <gr str="5971">people </gr>to the <gr str="2022">mountain</gr>; there they shall <gr str="2076">offer </gr>
